<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<rdf:RDF xmlns:contract="http://tunnelmodeling.org/research-contract#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:ns11="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:ns12="http://swrl.stanford.edu/ontologies/3.3/swrla.owl#" xmlns:ns3="http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#" xmlns:ns8="http://tunnelmodeling.org/unit-contract#" xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:rbr="http://tunnelmodeling.org/six-input-mining-composite#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:review="http://tunnelmodeling.org/expert-review#" xmlns:schema="https://schema.org/" xmlns:swrl="http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#" xmlns:tunnel="http://tunnelmodeling.org/ontology#" xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/">
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/bot#intersectsZone">
    <schema:rangeIncludes rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/bot#Space"/>
    <schema:rangeIncludes rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/bot#Storey"/>
    <schema:rangeIncludes rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/bot#Building"/>
    <schema:rangeIncludes rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/bot#Site"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="nl">snijdt door zone</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">intersecte zone</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ca">interseca amb zona</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="sk">pretína zónu</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="pt">intersecta zona</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="fi">leikkaa vyöhykettä</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="cs">protíná zónu</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="fa">منطقه متلاقی</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">interseca zona</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Bölge ile temas</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="de">sich schneidende Zone</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="da">skærer zone</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="sv">skär zon</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh-cn">相交区域</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">intersects zone</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">interseca con zona</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="sk">Vzťach dvoch zón, ktoré sa pretínajú svojim priestorovým rozhraním. Príkladom môže byť eskalátor prestupujúci cez vac zón-podlaží.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Relación entre dos zonas cuya extensión hace que una interseccione con la otra. Por ejemplo, una escalera cruza diferentes pisos.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Relazione tra due zone le cui estensioni 3D si intersecano. Per esempio, una tromba delle scale interseca vari piani.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="nl">Een relatie tussen twee zones waarvan de driedimensionale omvang doorsnijdend is. Bijvoorbeeld een traphal die verschillende verdiepingen doorsnijdt.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fr">Relation entre deux zones dont l'étendue 3D se croise. Par exemple, une cage d'escalier croise différents étages.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="sv">Relationen mellan två zoner vars tredimensionella utsträckning korsar varandra. Till exempel, ett trapphus som skär igenom flera våningar.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fi">Suhde kahden vyöhykkeen välillä, jotka leikkaavat toisiaan. Esimerkiksi rappuset leikkaavat useita kerroksia.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="fa">رابطه بین دو منطقه که حدود سه بعدی آنها با هم تلاقی دارد. برای مثال، یک راه پله از منطقه های مختلف عبور می کند و با آنها تلاقی دارد.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="pt">Relação entre duas zonas cuja extensão tridimensional se intersecta. Por exemplo, uma caixa de escadas intersecta vários pisos.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relationship between two zones whose 3D extent intersect. For example, a stairwell intersects different storeys.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="da">Forholdet mellem to zoner, hvis 3D-omfang skærer hinanden. For eksempel skærer et trappehus forskellige etager.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="de">Beziehung zwischen zwei Zonen, die sich schneiden. Zum Beispiel schneidet eine Treppe verschiedene Geschosse.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="ca">Relació entre dues zones l'extensió fa que una interseccioni amb l'altra. Per exemple, una escala creua diferents pisos.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="tr">3D kapsamı kesişen iki bölge arasındaki ilişki. Örneğin, bir merdiven boşluğu farklı katlarla kesişir.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="cs">Vztah dvou zón, které se protínají svým prostorovým ohraničením. Na příklad, eskalátor protíná vícero podlažních zón.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/bot#Zone"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <schema:domainIncludes rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/bot#Building"/>
    <schema:domainIncludes rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/bot#Space"/>
    <schema:domainIncludes rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/bot#Site"/>
    <schema:domainIncludes rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/bot#Storey"/>
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/bot#"/>
    <ns3:term_status>stable</ns3:term_status>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/bot#Zone"/>
    <owl:propertyDisjointWith rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/bot#adjacentZone"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://tunnelmodeling.org/ontology#hasCrossingType">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://tunnelmodeling.org/ontology#TunnelProject"/>
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://tunnelmodeling.org/ontology#TunnelProject_LegacyDataProperty"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://tunnelmodeling.org/six-input-mining-composite#TB822_V_DeepTunnelProject_2">
    <rbr:shotcrete_arch_wall_cmMax rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">23</rbr:shotcrete_arch_wall_cmMax>
    <rbr:shotcrete_arch_wall_cmMin rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">20</rbr:shotcrete_arch_wall_cmMin>
    <rbr:bolt_spacing_mMax rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">1</rbr:bolt_spacing_mMax>
    <rbr:secondary_arch_wall_cmMax rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">45</rbr:secondary_arch_wall_cmMax>
    <rbr:secondary_arch_wall_cmMin rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">40</rbr:secondary_arch_wall_cmMin>
    <rdfs:seeAlso>https://www.scribd.com/document/716889360/铁路隧道设计规范</rdfs:seeAlso>
    <rbr:bolt_length_mMin rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</rbr:bolt_length_mMin>
    <rbr:schemeReference>TB 10003—2016 第8.2.2条条文说明，说明表8.2.2 pp.217—218</rbr:schemeReference>
    <rbr:schemeMeaning>整行候选参考参数；非最终设计；喷层为平均厚度；二衬仅拱墙，不代表仰拱</rbr:schemeMeaning>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://tunnelmodeling.org/six-input-mining-composite#SupportScheme"/>
    <rbr:bolt_spacing_mMin rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double">0.8</rbr:bolt_spacing_mMin>
    <rbr:bolt_length_mMax rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double">3.5</rbr:bolt_length_mMax>
    <rbr:schemeConditions>{"grade": "V", "rock_hardness": null, "burial": "DeepTunnelProject", "excavation_span_m": {"lower_exclusive": 8.5, "upper_inclusive": 12}, "bolt_layout": "ArchAndWall", "applicability": "仅在规范说明表适用范围；特殊围岩等单独设计；未确认条件不得默认为真"}</rbr:schemeConditions>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://tunnelmodeling.org/ontology#hasWaterLevelDepth">
